407:   sits untracked is not evidence and cannot be weighed by a closure; a report that says "cancelled …
408:   unperformed" while three delivered reports lie untracked misstates the round. Grounding:
409:   `corpus/lessons/round-42-verifier-spotcheck.md` §Step-1 conformance, defect D1 — `CritC1Claim`,
410:   `CritSeparabilityTip`, `CritTradesTip` untracked with mtimes 18:16:29–18:18:04 -03 after lane close
