415:   - **Who checks.** The lane L1 immediately before the report commit; the non-author closure repeats
416:     the disk-versus-tracked diff and the fleet-side sweep.
417:   - **Field.** At the report's revision, every `.md` file under `.ufo/waves/round-<N>/` on disk is
418:     tracked, and `git status --porcelain --untracked-files=all` for that directory prints nothing. A
419:     report delivered after the sweep is committed as late evidence with a `late-delivered <ISO>` line
420:     and the report's disposition line is corrected in the next round's report. The fleet-side
421:     `.ufo/waves/round-<N>` and `.ufo/reports/round-<N>` are swept the same way (misroot).
